{
  "work_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis",
  "source_path": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis.json",
  "source_language": "chu",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-29",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.105r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "81843908390a03a8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "March 22. The martyrdom of Saints Trophimus and Eucarpion."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.105r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "7c4570a7a17bb301",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "There was great uproar and turmoil, beloved brothers, and the emperor was threatening God's servants fiercely."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.105r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "a7fb7506c449ae2c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The governors everywhere were committing terrible evils and devising new and cruel tortures. There were"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.105v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "a5446007e374e522",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "many rewards offered by the emperor, so that whoever found a Christian and handed him over"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.105v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "d22682a696258fb8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "would receive the rewards. And so, with every kind of harm and every kind of misery,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.105v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "8bd0e84b600ee6af",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "everything everywhere was filled. But the Lord helped all who struggled to endure martyrdom,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.105v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "9184dddfdb28d4f5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as happened with the glorious martyrs Trophimus and Eucarpion."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.105v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "c04475956021ce79",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "These two holy martyrs were soldiers serving under the governor who tortured the Christians."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.105v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "839bcb88f6eda2aa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He trusted no one else but these two in matters of torture, for they were cruel and inhuman,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.105v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "760f8edd027ddef5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and they treated God's servants with the utmost cruelty. Trophimus and Eucarpion were sent"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.105v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "c9bcb3f27da5f9b7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to torture those called servants of God and to bind all who associated with them"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.105v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "7ac49fee96b5cfaf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and shared the same faith. They went along devising bitter tortures."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.105v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "7cecd521f2a0af07",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "While they were thinking in this way, something like this happened, unknown to unbelievers"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.105v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "a61d16c196f7edae",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and quite unknown even to believers. For a great fire, with a loud noise,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.105v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "0cca5e269ca013ae",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "kept sending out a voice in the air: “Where are you hastening, Trophimus"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.105v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "b50c31373d56512e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and Eucarpion? Why are you threatening my servants? You will not overpower them"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.105v.s14",
      "source_sha256": "e5a857360907623f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "or defeat them. Instead, you too will be with them, for I have thus shown you mercy.” Hearing this,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "262018a61c583634",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "those two cruel, savage, and inhuman men fell to the ground, unable to bear either the sight or the voice."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "255b3e161e20c09d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Kneeling down and covering their faces, they said, “Who is this great God"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "f091a5358d200a95",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "who has appeared and spoken to us? We would be blessed if we were his servants.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "8c5ec219d08f81ad",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "As they said this in great fear, the fiery cloud split open and stood still, and a voice came from it,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "2147f766f3445331",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "saying, “Rise and repent, and your sins will be forgiven.” When they had regained their composure, they rose with hope"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "853e80af7cfe71aa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and saw someone in white robes sitting in the midst of the cloud, with many standing before him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "ee1c915e24bbd631",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Astonished at the sight, they said, “Receive us, Lord, as we give an account"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "f2b6a6c826757b0a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of the sins we have committed.” When they had said this, the cloud immediately vanished."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "aac4e0d0f1eae5ca",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "These two wept and grieved over the great evil they had done. They prayed with tears, falling down"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "fe9ada429e7ce545",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and asking forgiveness for their sins. When they came near Nicomedia,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "37b101e21bf52043",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "those living in the city expected some harm to come from them"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "da2edc06d002af7a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to the Christians there. The two immediately went to the praetorium, that is, the court, where"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "073eeceeef3ba194",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the governor had ordered them to stay. But they forgot the purpose for which they had been sent."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "03b3fc2d9b745b8e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They remembered neither the emperor’s law nor his commands, but chose instead God’s law, which is salvation for soul and body."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "c8f174b3b6a85440",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They entered the prison and immediately released those who were there, calling them brothers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "b1d06366da4c30e0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They recounted the vision that had occurred and declared, “We too wish to become Christians.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "aaa1468d1d901165",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "To many this seemed an astonishing thing: Trophimus and Eucarpus,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "758ef05c03be70b1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "renowned for their cruelty and boldness, and sent by the governor to torture Christians,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "4371b735622b5550",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "had disregarded the governor’s command and were instead helping the Christians."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "f132f5bba6339630",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When the governor heard what had happened, he came to Nicomedia."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "030154258c20a114",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He summoned them and said, “What has happened to you, you most wretched of all people?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "22bbfd23702239d3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "How have your resolute souls suddenly changed? Have you been poisoned? Tell me! Or have you lost your minds?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "8e1c5cc204510421",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Gather your wits and come to your senses, lest you suffer the very things you have so often done to others.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.106v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "61311b3206b9bb20",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The two answered, “Because we did those things, we came to know the Lord, the true Word made known. We understood whom"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.107r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "4968ca822aca0286",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "we had done them to. We wish to be with those people; we long to live with them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.107r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "b98f3bb84554a1f4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] May you find men more cruel and inhuman, so that they may do the same things to us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.107r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "0ef665b92655d539",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that were done to God’s servants, the confessors of the Christian faith."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.107r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "d254b36284c3a4ca",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "May we too be found worthy to be with them. In this way we answer for the sins we have committed.” When the two had said this,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.107r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "90d20d66d12a7251",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the governor ordered them to be beaten on their sides with rods and their wounds rubbed with haircloth. But he achieved nothing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.107r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "ceea5ab9e641afd7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He saw that they endured it gladly. Finally, having been defeated, he pronounced sentence on them:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.107r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "e19bc2ab51968b9f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he ordered them to be consigned to the fire. The two courageously endured the wounds inflicted on them"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.107r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "0e572e0f0e8f4884",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and were numbered among those who had suffered, together with the holy martyrs."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.107r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "194afeb5df2497eb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They were found worthy to receive the kingdom of heaven. Thus the two holy martyrs of God died."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.107r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "87133c6ef94f5e5a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 2,
      "text": "In the city of Nicomedia. In Christ our Lord, with whom glory and power be to the Father."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-trophimi-et-eucarpionis#Supr.107r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "cfc027d8b92a09cf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 2,
      "text": "With the Holy Spirit, now and always and forever and ever. Amen."
    }
  ]
}
